# Tier-1 sensing: median depth at the last scan's detection pixels → which
# layer is on top? Replaces the legacy 70%-count layer-completion heuristic
# (bin.py) with a measurement. Served by localization_node; called by the task
# manager when a layer's targets are exhausted.

---
float64 median_z      # median live depth at the last detection pixels, mm
int8 layer_index      # nearest layer number derived from can_height_mm; -1 if unknown
